# Remember to never publicly share your keystore.
# See https://flutter.dev/to/reference-keystore
key.properties
**/*.keystore
**/*.jks

# Exception: app/debug.keystore is a dedicated, non-secret debug-only
# signing key committed on purpose so that every build (local and CI)
# shares the same signature. This keeps app updates/installs working
# without wiping user data. It must never be used for a real release.
!app/debug.keystore
